---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const groups = [
  {
    org: "Image and Signal Processing Group (ISP)",
    place: "Universitat de València",
    people: "Luis Gómez-Chova (PI) · Cesar Aybar · Julio Contreras",
  },
  {
    org: "Land and Atmosphere Remote Sensing (LARS)",
    place: "Universitat Politècnica de València",
    people: "Luis Guanter",
  },
  {
    org: "Remote Sensing Centre for Earth System Research (RSC4Earth)",
    place: "Leipzig University",
    people: "Miguel D. Mahecha · David Montero",
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="Project · MethaneSET"
  description="Team, funding and links for the MethaneSET dataset project."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Project</p>
      <h2>About</h2>
      <p>
        MethaneSET is a benchmark of multi-sensor datasets for the detection and
        quantification of methane leaks from space. It unifies Sentinel-2, Landsat-8/9 and
        EMIT under one TACO schema, with plume annotations from two independent operational
        systems (IMEO MARS and Carbon Mapper) and a synthetic plume bank derived from
        WRF-LES simulations.
      </p>
      <p>
        The project builds on the TACO specification to make methane data FAIR:
        findable, accessible, interoperable and reusable, so models can be trained and
        compared across sensors without weeks of preprocessing.
      </p>

      <h2>Team</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Group</th><th>Institution</th><th>People</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {
            groups.map((g) => (
              <tr>
                <td>{g.org}</td>
                <td>{g.place}</td>
                <td>{g.people}</td>
              </tr>
            ))
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Funding</h2>
      <p>
        Funded by the Climate Change AI (CCAI) Innovation Grants program, hosted by CCAI
        with the support of the Global Methane Hub (GMH), grant G-2025-00888. Supported
        also by the Spanish Ministry of Science, Innovation and Universities
        (PID2023-148485OB-C21 / C22, funded by MCIU / AEI / 10.13039 / 501100011033, ERDF,
        EU).
      </p>
      <p>
        We thank UNEP's International Methane Emissions Observatory (IMEO) for the MARS
        plume annotations, Carbon Mapper for their public detections, and NASA LP DAAC for
        the EMIT Level 1B radiance data.
      </p>

      <h2>Links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/IPL-UV/taco-methaneset" target="_blank" rel="noopener">This website (GitHub)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/tacofoundation/methaneset" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Datasets on Hugging Face</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://asterisk.coop/taco/spec" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TACO specification</a></li>
      </ul>

      <span class="src">
        Team and funding from the project description and the manuscript acknowledgements.
      </span>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
